    "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12624 fixes it in a way that's very similar to the blink implementation.\nNote that we still have an intermediate inert document - this is essential to avoid some of the pre-sanitization side effects.\nBut the main difference is that elements are inserted directly to a fragment and not to a dummy connected root element of an inert document.",
